{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415485","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415485","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041548501:1":{"text":"우와! 이게 누구야? 또 한 명의 트라이브 용사잖아!","source_cn":"嘿！我看到了谁？又一位蛮血勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5301D856C8D1011E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548502:1":{"text":"군가 축제의 심판으로서, 이 칼라가 다음 군가 축제에 정중히 초대할게요!","source_cn":"作为战歌节的裁判，曼卡拉向你发出郑重的邀请——请你来参...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD24D0C2F1844D3CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548503:1":{"text":"음... 군가 축제?","source_cn":"啊……战歌节？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC17AB30EBBF0F2C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548504:1":{"text":"맞아요. 군가 축제! 아센 사막에서 열리는 트라이브 만의 성대한 축제이자 힘을 겨루는 영광의 전장이죠!","source_cn":"没错，战歌节！在荒角沙漠上举办的、属于蛮血的盛大节日！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CF5EC1EA0C37CD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548505:1":{"text":"트라이브라면 모두 다 알고 있을 텐데요! 들어본 적 없나요?","source_cn":"每个蛮血都应该知道！难道你没有听说过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4FAA151A36EC722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548506:1":{"text":"그런 건 아니고, 너무 오랜만에 들어보는 단어라 확인해 본 것뿐이에요.","source_cn":"不，我只是太久没有听到这个词，确认一下而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7504F0204DFCC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548507:1":{"text":"미안해요, 전 군가 축제에 관심이 없어요.","source_cn":"抱歉，亲爱的，我对战歌节没兴趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8E734E2BAAF4E6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548508:1":{"text":"솔직히 말하면 전 아센 사막을 떠난 지 꽤 오래되었어요. 다시 돌아갈 생각도 없고요.","source_cn":"实不相瞒，我已经离开荒角沙漠很多年了，也不准备再回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CA472A63DD32345","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548509:1":{"text":"제가 뭘 들은 거죠?! 당신처럼 타고난 용사가 군가 축제 초대를 거절하다니! 그건 모든 트라이브가 동경하는 최고의 명예라고요!","source_cn":"我听到了什么？！像你这样的天生的勇士，居然拒绝了战歌节...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D2F2C0ADA0A95A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548510:1":{"text":"이 칼라의 예감으로, 당신의 재능이라면 최종 승리를 못하더라도 좋은 성적을 거둘 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"凭借你的天赋——曼卡拉有预感——即使不能获得最终的胜利...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE35B6E198B04F049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548511:1":{"text":"정말 도전해 보지 않으실 건가요? 군가 축제의 관중들이 열렬한 박수 소리로 당신을 환영해 줄 거예요!","source_cn":"真的不来试试吗？战歌节的观众会用最热烈的掌声欢迎你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF588BE8C79C9066B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548512:1":{"text":"힘으로 명예를 얻기보다는, 평온한 나날을 보내고 싶어요. 미안해요.","source_cn":"比起用力量获得的荣誉，我更想过平静的日子。抱歉啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42B0900F7849A9DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548513:1":{"text":"하지만 군가 축제의 후원사가 필요한 거라면 이야기를 나눠볼 수 있어요.","source_cn":"不过，如果战歌节需要赞助商的话，或许我们可以聊一聊哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EBDB0FFDAB29C14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041548514:1":{"text":"...네?!","source_cn":"……哎？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5D39E679BC4EBB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"칼라","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"게르다","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}